            </note>
            <note corresp="#d973-f3" n="3" xml:id="d973-f3-content">
                <p><hi rendition="#italic"><ref target="#d973">Supra</ref></hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d973-f4" n="4" xml:id="d973-f4-content">
                <p>Not printed. (FOA files, lot 55 A 374, box 12)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d973-f5" n="5" xml:id="d973-f5-content">
                <p>Pursuant to these instructions, Briggs and Wood delivered a memorandum to Rhee to
                    this effect, the text of which was transmitted in telegram 658, Dec. 7, 1954.
                    (611.95B/12–754)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
